# Stacked Carousel — 20 white cards in a 3D stack driven by an invisible snapping
# horizontal FlatList: the front card scales up, lifts and fades out as the next
# one tilts (rotateX) forward; a windowed 3-dot paginator springs along.
# What this test covers: single-card swipes forwards and backwards, a short
# drag that snaps back, flings through all 20 cards to the end (paginator
# window shifting, far-card style short-circuits) and over-scrolling past the
# last card, reversing mid-momentum, and flinging back past the first card.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/stacked-carousel"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 1500
gesture pan 330 437 -200 0 500
wait 900
gesture pan 330 437 -200 0 500
wait 900
gesture pan 70 437 200 0 500
wait 900
# Short drag: snaps back.
gesture pan 250 437 -60 0 600
wait 900
# Fling to the end.
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 500
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 1000
gesture pan 350 437 -300 0 700
wait 1200
# Reverse mid-momentum.
gesture fling right 60 437 250
wait 120
gesture fling left 340 437 250
wait 1000
# Back towards the start and past it.
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 400
gesture pan 60 437 300 0 300
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
